{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:42:26+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:42:26+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"M&G plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://group.mandg.com","employees":6455,"summary":"M&G plc, through its subsidiaries, provides investment and savings products to institutional clients and individual policyholders in the United Kingdom and internationally. The company operates through Asset Management and Life segments. The Asset Management segment offers managed investment products, such as equities, fixed income, and multi-asset, as well as real estate investment products and services to wholesale clients and institutional investors. The Life segment provides corporate pension solutions, individual life and pensions, and international solutions and advice; and Prudential guaranteed income plan. This segment also offers level annuities, which provide a fixed annuity payment; fixed increase annuities, which incorporate a periodic automatic fixed increase in annuity payments; inflation-linked annuities, which incorporate a periodic increase based on a defined inflation index; and with-profits annuities, written in the with-profits fund, combining income features of annuity contracts with the investment-smoothing features of with-profits products. The company was formerly known as M&G Prudential PLC and changed its name to M&G plc in September 2019. M&G plc was founded in 1848 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"M&G plc, par l'intermédiaire de ses filiales, fournit des produits d'investissement et d'épargne à des clients institutionnels et à des assurés individuels au Royaume-Uni et à l'étranger. La société opère à travers les segments Asset Management et Life. Le secteur de la gestion d'actifs offre des produits de placement gérés, tels que des actions, des titres à revenu fixe et des actifs multiples, ainsi que des produits et des services de placement immobilier à des clients de gros et à des investisseurs institutionnels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":7692979200,"shares_outstanding":2382465059,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":10.362644,"price_to_book":295.69595,"ev_to_ebitda":3.623,"ev_to_revenue":1.244,"dividend_yield":0.0642,"payout_ratio":1.6423,"beta_yahoo":0.973},"targets":{"current_price":322.9,"mean":326.105,"median":330.0,"high":370.0,"low":215.00002,"n_analysts":12,"reco_mean":2.66667,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-09-03"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-09-10","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.17524,"institutions_pct":0.485,"institutions_float_pct":0.58805,"institutions_n":307,"institutions":[{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":19000,"value":6135099,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0454}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0124,"shares":29905242,"value":9656402459,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0458},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0081,"shares":19460400,"value":6283763041,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0546},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0066000004,"shares":16001959,"value":5167032463,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0117},{"name":"Fidelity Concord Street Trust-Fidelity International Index Fund","pct":0.0036000002,"shares":8795965,"value":2840217044,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.013099999},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0033000002,"shares":7853000,"value":2535733652,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.003,"shares":7170029,"value":2315202320,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.077